message: "If you use Medora, please cite the archived v1.0.1 release and the SoftwareX article."
title: "Medora: A Bilingual, consent-gated AI-native healthcare management & consultation platform for Bangladesh"
type: software
version: 1.0.1
authors:
  - family-names: Siddiqui
    given-names: Sarwad Hasan
  - family-names: Tahsin
